


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_83148229:


    "——宿管室。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_623b826a:



    voice "2MI_1056"
    miyako "「你们两位已经知道的吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_1c8fae65:


    "圣夜子一脸懵圈地问道。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_040b6060:



    voice "2HI_1588"
    hina "「嗯，算是吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_a_609cceff:



    voice "2HI_1589"
    hina "「咦，话说圣夜子为什么在宿管室这里的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_a_03108e0a:



    voice "2MI_1057"
    miyako "「那个嘛……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_a_33d46ac1:



    voice "2SA_0876"
    sachiko "「怎么说呢，算是鹰冈家的私事吧……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_a_bcc563f1:



    voice "2HI_1590"
    hina "「哦好吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_a_f28c4e47:


    "阳菜也没有深究，然后继续刚才的话题。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_b_4967b068:



    voice "2HI_1591"
    hina "「我们一开始就知道浅生她是不打算参加这个试镜的了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_b_6758b88d:


    "阳菜把视线转向共犯。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_b_32aedb11:



    voice "2SA_0877"
    sachiko "「我的话是觉得这个挺有意思，所以就建议文去参加一下当个纪念之类的。不过她说之前上了次电视就够了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_b_138da888:



    voice "2HI_1592"
    hina "「不过嘛，最主要的原因还是不愿意牺牲和伦在一起的时间」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_b_4a43ee6b:



    voice "2MI_1058"
    miyako "「原来如此。确实很有文的风格」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_b_e6cc6d02:



    voice "2SA_0878"
    sachiko "「然而文她其实也很烦恼哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_b_b3c5bdc4:



    voice "2MI_1059"
    miyako "「嗯～～担心会不会因为太过宠溺伦而把伦变成个废人……之类的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_b_b4b80857:


    hina_sachiko "「没错！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_b_8e849486:


    "圣夜子果然很敏锐。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_b_9848ce97:



    voice "2HI_1594"
    hina "「所以浅生她来找我们商量时我们就给出这样的建议了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_b_183d1834:



    voice "2SA_0880"
    sachiko "「先不告诉伦关于文不打算参加试镜的事然后暂时拉开一下两人之间的距离」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_b_ce89d3a1:



    voice "2HI_1595"
    hina "「没错。然后估计伦会因此而产生危机感了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_b_c9ca8bce:



    voice "2MI_1060"
    miyako "「非常有效果呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_b_8460d117:



    voice "2SA_0881"
    sachiko "「这不是那么简单的哦？不过因为伦她比较好懂所以从头到尾都能够按计划进行」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_b_7003d8f2:



    voice "2HI_1596"
    hina "「然而实际上却是浅生她已经无法离开伦而逐渐开始宣告投降了啊。想着说差不多要到极限了所以就把期限定在情人节了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_b_9fbc6fa3:



    voice "2MI_1061"
    miyako "「啊～」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_b_1b758a09:



    voice "2SA_0882"
    sachiko "「没想到后来她母亲突然病倒让状况变得有点节外生枝了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_b_a7f8738f:



    voice "2MI_1062"
    miyako "「原来如此。有那种事啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_b_b854c06f:



    voice "2SA_0883"
    sachiko "「伦一心想着文将会成为偶像所以想方设法让自己不成为文的绊脚石。而文则是想着自己这样会捣毁伦那前程无量的人生」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_b_d623ffa9:



    voice "2HI_1597"
    hina "「浅生和伦对彼此怀着相同的想法呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_b_46bd1ddc:


    "这让我想起《麦琪的礼物》了。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_b_3a660ad8:



    voice "2MI_1063"
    miyako "「不过真的好厉害啊。这不是几乎完全按照计划进行了吗。为什么能想出那么周密的计划呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_b_86786dc7:


    hina_sachiko "「因为事不关己啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_b_67641798:



    voice "2MI_1064"
    miyako "「诶？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_b_4afa1229:



    voice "2SA_0885"
    sachiko "「没，我说的不是指冷漠的那种意思。就是俗话说的旁观者清吧，有些事从旁人的角度来看会更清晰哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_b_5fd9f6c7:



    voice "2HI_1599"
    hina "「对。尽管对她们本人来说是头等大事，但在别人看来只是在不断地秀恩爱而已」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_b_ffb1fd2e:



    voice "2SA_0886"
    sachiko "「所以其实答案之类的很快就出来了。只不过她们本人看不见而已」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_b_62a27bc0:


    "阳菜和祥子笑了笑。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_b_389c993b:



    voice "2MI_1065"
    miyako "「是那么一回事吗……不，说不定就是那样呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_b_075b32e6:


    "恐怕圣夜子脑海里浮现出的，是自己身为天使时所看见的东西吧。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_c_590f48ab:


    "——旁观者清。这个世界就是如此。无论是你，还是我。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_09_d_cc969258:


    "——旁观者清。这个世界就是如此。你当然也不例外哦。"
